     QQ__IINNII() returns the initialised Q number which can be used to chain ini‐
     tialise additional Q numbers.

     QQ__TTOOSSTTRR() returns a pointer to the '\0' C-string terminator appended to _s
     after the rendered numeric data, or NULL on buffer overflow.

     QQ__DDFFVV22BBFFVV() returns the binary-encoded representation of decimal frac‐
     tional value _d_f_v with _n_f_b_i_t_s of binary precision.

